    "game:traitdesc-clothier": "Exclusive craftables: <a href=\"handbook://item-sewingkit\">sewing kit</a> and various <a href=\"handbooksearch://clothing\">clothing</a>, including winter clothes and ability to create cheaper <a href=\"handbook://item-flaxtwine\">twines</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-sail\">sails</a> and <a href=\"handbook://item-sail-large-oak\">large sails</a>",
    "game:traitdesc-transmutation": "Able to create <a href=\"handbook://item-ore-sulfur\">sulfur</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-saltpeter\">saltpeter</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-rot\">rot</a> from bones, transmute <a href=\"handbook://item-metalbit-silver\">silver</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-metalbit-gold\">gold</a> and <a href=\"handbook://item-metalbit-electrum\">electrum</a>, efficiently craft <a href=\"handbook://block-bomb-scrap\">scrap bombs</a> and <a href=\"handbook://item-blastingpowder\">blasting powder</a>",
    "game:traitdesc-tinkerer": "Exclusive craftable <a href=\"handbook://item-spear-generic-hacking\">Tuning spear</a> to tame locusts and ability to craft <a href=\"handbooksearch://mechanical\">mechanical parts</a> and <a href=\"handbooksearch://chute\">chutes</a> with higher efficiency",
    "game:traitdesc-surgeon": "Able to craft a <a href=\"handbook://poultice-grass-flower\">weak poultice from grass and flowers</a> and create <a href=\"handbooksearch://poultice from\">all other polutices</a> and <a href=\"handbook://item-bandage-clean\">bandages</a> more efficiently",
    "game:traitdesc-mason": "Creates <a href=\"handbook://item-mortar\">mortar</a>, <a href=\"handbook://block-plaster-plain\">plaster</a>, <a href=\"handbooksearch://unfired refractory\">refractory</a>, and <a href=\"handbook://item-rawbrick-fire\">raw bricks</a> at lower costs, can directly make <a href=\"handbooksearch://ashlar block\">stone bricks</a> from stones, and has access to <a href=\"handbook://item-burnedbrick-brown\">brown clay bricks.</a>"
